            </li>
            <li data-state="active">
                <span class="phase__id">P1</span>
                <div>
                    <h2>Minimal editing and static playback</h2>
                    <p>
                        Create and open a native project, edit basic text, images
                        and shapes, page through a full-screen show, save and
                        reopen with the same revision.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </li>
            <li>
                <span class="phase__id">P2</span>
                <div>
                    <h2>PPTX round trip</h2>
                    <p>
                        Import, edit and export PPTX with a per-object support
                        matrix, plus an independent reopen check.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </li>
            <li>
                <span class="phase__id">P3</span>
                <div>
                    <h2>Agent design loop</h2>
                    <p>
                        Themes, semantic layouts, inspection, contact sheets and
                        revisions that target a single object.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </li>
            <li>
                <span class="phase__id">P4</span>
                <div>
                    <h2>Skills acceptance</h2>
                    <p>
                        Install the skills package in a clean environment and
                        finish real authoring tasks with editable output.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </li>
            <li>
                <span class="phase__id">P5</span>
                <div>
                    <h2>Speaker view and media</h2>
                    <p>
                        Presenter view, multiple displays, transitions, object
                        animation and media synchronisation.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </li>
            <li>
                <span class="phase__id">P6</span>
                <div>
                    <h2>Standalone and suite releases</h2>
                    <p>
                        Ship OpenPPT on its own and as part of the OpenOffice
                        suite, built from one engine.
                    </p>
                </div>
            </li>
        </ol>

        <section class="section">
            <h2>Where the tests live</h2>
            <p>
                PPTX corpora, visual baselines, independent round trips, skill
